#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:5 a7abba908c7f4db49a11127f25910538
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:7 c28f37d8d24346509a94dd7915527dd7
msgid ""
"The antenna tracker requires much of the same basic configuration as Copter "
"and Plane and then some specific configuration specific to the antenna "
"tracker. Below are the details of this set-up."
msgstr "天线跟踪器与 Copter、Plane 共享大部分基础配置，同时还有一些专属于天线跟踪器的特定配置。下面是详细的设置说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:14 736aa762153c4aed8acf8aefa6f395cf
msgid "Setting the AHRS orientation"
msgstr "设置 AHRS 朝向"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:16 46dc0a05f6214fa7afa241f19718605e
msgid ""
"If the flight controller board could not be mounted so that its forward "
"direction is aligned with the antenna (as mentioned on the :ref:`Assembling "
"a frame page <frame-assembly>`) the AHRS_ORIENTATION parameter should be set"
" from the Mission Planner's Config/Tuning >> Advanced Params screen."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控板的前向方向无法与天线方向对齐（详见 :ref:`机架装配页面 <frame-assembly>`），应在 Mission Planner 的 "
"Config/Tuning >> Advanced Params 页面设置 AHRS_ORIENTATION 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:24 086880e0c7bf490998f56850c1aa476e
msgid "Some commonly used values include:"
msgstr "常用值包括："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:26 8f2cbcd2af8d4fbfb186b7d3134cdc28
msgid ""
"Pitch90 : the flight controller is pointing up at 90 degrees compared to the"
" direction of the antenna"
msgstr "Pitch90：飞控板相对天线朝向向上偏转 90 度"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:28 7e2cde90b4bc43ffb205c72f8e050545
msgid ""
"Pitch270 : the flight controller is pointing down at 90 degrees compared to "
"the direction of the antenna"
msgstr "Pitch270：飞控板相对天线朝向向下偏转 90 度"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:32 f5b89bcdae4943e1a6d08f619095fe87
msgid "Accelerometer Calibration"
msgstr "加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:34 a3a55f34063341ab86362e7ba387af85
msgid ""
"The :ref:`accelerometer calibration <copter:common-accelerometer-"
"calibration>` is the same as for Copter meaning the flight controller board "
"should be connected to the Mission planner and then the **Initial Setup \\| "
"Mandatory Hardware \\| Accel Calibration** routine should be run which "
"involves holding the board in 6 separate orientations positions so that "
"offsets and scaling can be calculated."
msgstr ""
":ref:`加速度计校准 <copter:common-accelerometer-calibration>` 与 Copter "
"流程相同：将飞控板连接到 Mission Planner，然后运行 **Initial Setup | Mandatory Hardware | "
"Accel Calibration** 流程，在 6 种不同方位握住飞控板，以便计算偏移与缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:44 666e3b848c474067a17a35b091b3e1b4
msgid "Setting the Compass orientation"
msgstr "设置罗盘朝向"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:46 94354e09f2c2441eb3964897ed4bfe89
msgid ""
"If an external GPS+compass module is being used but the arrow on the case "
"could not be aligned so as to point in the same direction as the antenna, "
"the COMPASS_ORIENTATION parameter should be set."
msgstr "如果使用外置 GPS+罗盘模块，但壳体上的箭头无法与天线朝向对齐，应设置 COMPASS_ORIENTATION 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:53 f536ba08a7d04000b05ab5bad0f0b847
msgid "Some more commonly used values include:"
msgstr "另一些常用值包括："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:55 2a9a0f9e333e407cbb233dfd252c88f6
msgid ""
"Yaw 90 : the arrow on the compass module is pointing off to the right at a "
"90 degree angle clockwise from the direction the antenna is pointing."
msgstr "Yaw 90：罗盘模块上的箭头相对天线朝向顺时针偏转 90 度，指向右侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:58 94d14713caba4dfe8b75de3f5c3e40ed
msgid ""
"Yaw 270: the arrow is pointing to the left at 90degrees from the antenna. "
"I.e. the arrow is rotated at 90deg counter-clockwise from where the antenna "
"is pointed."
msgstr "Yaw 270：箭头相对天线朝向逆时针偏转 90 度，指向左侧。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:63 94bd2248f60b4dfda4b7272c69d81b69
msgid "Compass Calibration"
msgstr "罗盘校准"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:65 6adac653f112490497fe946fd37c3415
msgid ""
"The :ref:`compass calibration <copter:common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner>` can be done using the same method as Copter.  Open the Mission "
"Planner's Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware >> Compass screen and push the"
" \"Live Calibration\" button and rotate the board until the mission planner "
"says it has captured enough points to correctly calculate the offsets."
msgstr ""
":ref:`罗盘校准 <copter:common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` 与 Copter "
"流程相同。打开 Mission Planner 的 Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware >> Compass "
"页面，点击「Live Calibration」按钮，并旋转飞控板，直到 Mission Planner 提示已采集到足以正确计算偏移的数据点。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:72 a25cf779e0974240981fbc338835d9f0
msgid "Setting the servo and range of movement"
msgstr "设置舵机与运动范围"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:74 9c764f6becb648d4bef7c8bb3c6ced57
msgid ""
"For this section it is best to plug in the battery so that the servos are "
"powered and push the \"arming switch\" if present.  Connect with the Mission"
" Planner, go to the CONFIG/TUNING >> Extended Tuning page."
msgstr ""
"本节建议先接好电池给舵机供电（如有安全开关也请按下）。然后用 Mission Planner 连接，进入 CONFIG/TUNING >> "
"Extended Tuning 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:82 a8873fd8d53045999170898d6bcb9090
msgid "Setting the Yaw servo's min and max pwm values"
msgstr "设置 Yaw 舵机的最小/最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:84 951c61054ce649acaadd664b4a11a4c5
msgid ""
"The green \"Test\" buttons on this screen work in conjunction with the Min, "
"Max field values and the slider position.  If the slider is pushed all the "
"way to the left and the Test button is pushed, the pwm value in the \"Min\" "
"field will be sent to the servo.  If the slider is pushed all the way to the"
" right and the Test button is pushed, the pwm value in the Max field will be"
" sent to the servo."
msgstr ""
"页面上的绿色「Test」按钮与 Min、Max 字段以及滑块位置配合使用。把滑块拖到最左然后点 Test，「Min」字段中的 PWM "
"值会被发送到舵机；把滑块拖到最右点 Test，Max 字段中的 PWM 值会被发送到舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:91 e3d6cfc97b1f433bb6b554993ac36ff4
msgid ""
"If the Yaw (aka pan) servo's minimum and maximum pwm values are known, they "
"can simply be entered into the Yaw Servo Min and Max fields.  If they are "
"not know, you can discover them through experimentation.  For example to "
"discover the minimum, push the slider all the way to the left and then enter"
" progressively lower pwm values (pushing the Test button after each change) "
"until you discover the lowest value that causes the servos to move. Repeat "
"for the Max field by pushing the slider all the way to the right and "
"entering progressively higher pwm values."
msgstr ""
"如果已知 Yaw（也即 Pan，水平转动）舵机的最小、最大 PWM 值，直接填入 Yaw Servo Min/Max "
"字段即可。如果不知道，可以通过实验摸索。例如要找最小值：将滑块拖到最左，逐步降低 PWM 值并每次点 "
"Test，直到找到能让舵机开始动作的最低值。最大值同理：将滑块拖到最右，逐步升高 PWM 值进行试探。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:100 5a50e9fb6a7c4cf6ba9d166390be047b
msgid ""
"Normally lower pwm values should cause the tracker to point to the right "
"(i.e. clockwise), higher values will point to the left (i.e. counter-"
"clockwise).  If this is not the case, the \"Reverse\" checkbox should be "
"checked.  Note that changing this checkbox will not affect how the tracker "
"operates when using the Test button."
msgstr ""
"通常较低的 PWM 值会让跟踪器指向右（顺时针），较高值指向左（逆时针）。如果方向反了，请勾选「Reverse」复选框。注意该勾选不影响使用 Test "
"按钮时跟踪器的动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:106 1ae35c2acb7f457d9b5f28ef73138ff5
msgid ""
"The Neutral field is the value that will be output to the servos when the "
"tracker first begins controlling them after startup."
msgstr "Neutral 字段是跟踪器启动后开始控制舵机时输出的初始值。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:110 70e4b6f167914932b1e3accb0d658602
msgid "Setting the Yaw servo's range of movement"
msgstr "设置 Yaw 舵机的运动范围"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:112 18d6d2c0312b47b589e5c9e8af794f5a
msgid ""
"In this step we want to discover the heading change that comes from moving "
"the servos between their minimum and maximum  values. One way to do this is "
"to:"
msgstr "本步骤的目的是测出 Yaw 舵机从最小值到最大值之间所对应的航向变化角度。一种做法是："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:116 b13a12940fbe41a2afd056db807cfe24
msgid ""
"Put the slider all the way to the left (if the Reverse checkbox is "
"unchecked) or right (if the Reverse checkbox is checked) and push the Test "
"button"
msgstr "将滑块拖到最左（若未勾选 Reverse）或最右（若勾选了 Reverse），点 Test"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:119 f6af05ec8dbb46f89ba4b9b091d148b8
msgid ""
"Rotate the tracker so that its heading (on the MP's Flight Data screen) "
"shows close to \"0\" (i.e. North)"
msgstr "旋转跟踪器，使其航向（Mission Planner 的 Flight Data 页面所示）接近「0」（即正北）"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:121 a5cbf6f5864a4ea4939968f225efe25b
msgid ""
"Return to the extended tuning page, push the slider all the way to the other"
" extreme and push Test"
msgstr "返回 Extended Tuning 页面，将滑块拖到另一端，点 Test"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:123 bffb822d212943398b6043de6743a5f7
msgid ""
"The new heading back on the Flight Data screen is the range of movement and "
"should be entered into the \"Range of movement field\"."
msgstr "回到 Flight Data 页面读取新的航向值，这就是运动范围，将其填入「Range of movement」字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:127 50ea67380e4b4b18ab871bc633b40e9a
msgid "Setting the Pitch servo's range of movement pwm values"
msgstr "设置 Pitch 舵机的运动范围 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:129 94244921fa7d44118447b5d062c37748
msgid ""
"Repeat the procedures described above to discover the Yaw servo's min and "
"max values except using the fields and buttons in the \"Pitch Servo\" "
"section of the Extended Tuning screen."
msgstr "按上文 Yaw 舵机的步骤重复一次，但要使用 Extended Tuning 页面中「Pitch Servo」一节对应的字段和按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:133 7efad69b85d74a6f9bbed64527dd8aeb
msgid ""
"Lower pwm values should cause the tracker to aim down, higher pwm values to "
"aim up.  If this is not the case, the \"Reverse\" checkbox should be "
"checked."
msgstr "较低的 PWM 值应让跟踪器朝下，较高值朝上。如果方向反了，请勾选「Reverse」复选框。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:138 9f7e9030ae434e6b8645dfcb47df97ae
msgid "Setting the Pitch servo's range of movement"
msgstr "设置 Pitch 舵机的运动范围"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:140 909335013bbf41439f78c0e38b72b03b
msgid ""
"Repeat the procedures used to discover the Yaw servo's range of movement "
"except that the difference in the Pitch values shown on the Mission "
"Planner's Flight Data screen should be used."
msgstr ""
"按上文 Yaw 舵机运动范围的步骤重复一次，只是要读取 Mission Planner Flight Data 页面所示 Pitch 值的变化量。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:145 7848f0a189b34fdcadb209e73d6bed16
msgid "Manually setting the parameters"
msgstr "手动设置参数"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:147 ce3ee92b6c2c4873aa7f81b8ddea724c
msgid ""
"If the mission planner is not being used the parameters below can be updated"
" manually:"
msgstr "如果不使用 Mission Planner，可以手动更新下列参数："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:150 bc68a2c604514beb9398bb9e7f03f1df
msgid "RC1\\_ parameters control the pan (aka yaw) servo"
msgstr "RC1\\_ 参数控制 Pan（也即 Yaw，水平转动）舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:152 de9ff32ad842468eb52f44ded8874eda
msgid "RC1_MIN : min pwm value that can be sent to the pan servo"
msgstr "RC1_MIN：可发送给 Pan 舵机的最小 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:154 ad950ac7b6fc4e188200ccb503980549
msgid "RC1_MAX : max pwm value that can be sent to the pan servo"
msgstr "RC1_MAX：可发送给 Pan 舵机的最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:156 7ed7ac71185341638b34a4294ed51f60
msgid "RC1_REV : set to \"-1\" if the tracker rotates in the wrong direction"
msgstr "RC1_REV：跟踪器转向相反时设为「-1」"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:158 5db399fc8f1f4492bdc09ce276778f22
msgid "RC2\\_ parameters control the tilt (aka pitch) servo"
msgstr "RC2\\_ 参数控制 Tilt（也即 Pitch，俯仰）舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:160 7afaa32627024c618108cd5c8bb4a6ff
msgid "RC2_MIN : min pwm value that can be sent to the tilt servo"
msgstr "RC2_MIN：可发送给 Tilt 舵机的最小 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:162 fba778edfbc84c76bc2a8e0dc0bc31c9
msgid "RC2_MAX : max pwm value that can be sent to the tilt servo"
msgstr "RC2_MAX：可发送给 Tilt 舵机的最大 PWM 值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:164 f7d9a93b969641d9bb023d4ecc601877
msgid ""
"RC2_REV : set to \"-1\" if the tracker tilts in the wrong direction (i.e. "
"tilts down when vehicle is above tracker)"
msgstr "RC2_REV：跟踪器俯仰方向反了（例如载具在跟踪器上方时它却朝下俯仰）时设为「-1」"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:169 e18066bfede94339a5c8ca5c6655e002
msgid ""
"For continuous rotation set YAW_RANGE equal to 360.  Make sure you hardware "
"setup (i.e. the cabling) can handle the tracker turning continuous circles."
msgstr "若需连续旋转，请将 YAW_RANGE 设为 360。务必确保硬件接线方式能承受跟踪器持续转圈。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:174 aeb8d91271ec488292d3c44b8deae9cb
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:176 08438ee6d2ab43e8b204aaa8cb5f3364
msgid "YAW2SRV_P, I and D values are set the pan control's gains."
msgstr "YAW2SRV_P、I、D 用于设置 Pan 控制的 PID 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration.rst:178 ce4bde65d5d046ce89d8d6c64e4e6591
msgid "PITCH2SRV_P, I and D values are set the tilt control's gains."
msgstr "PITCH2SRV_P、I、D 用于设置 Tilt 控制的 PID 增益。"
